---
title: "Custom symptom sync on one phone"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Forgot
    lg1: Lost
    lg2: Saving
    lg3: Settled
    lg4: Breaks EmptyKeeperSafe or ImportRemembers
    lg5: Path to the EmptyKeeperSafe or ImportRemembers bug
  }
  class lg0 orange
  class lg1 pink
  class lg2 yellow
  class lg3 teal
  class lg4 breaks
  class lg5 bugPath
  s0: No custom symptoms
  s1: One custom symptom
  s2: Import joined two names and forgot the pair
  s3: The pairs are saved and the store save is still open
  s4: A saved day is gone
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you add a symptom
  s0 --> s2: you import a backup that joined two names
  s1 --> s1: a row arrives with no record id
  s1 --> s3: the phone saves the remembered pairs
  s3 --> s1: the store save lands
  s3 --> s4: the store save lands
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 teal
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 orange
  class s2 breaks
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 yellow
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 pink
  class s4 breaks
  class s4 bugPath
